    "title": "The Children's Place",
    "description": "The Children\u2019s Place app is here with a NEW look and even more features that make shopping our retail family of brands better than ever! \r\n\r\n\u2022\tShop 4 brands in 1 place: \r\n\r\n<b>The Children\u2019s Place \u2013</b> all the toddler-to-big kid clothing (dresses, shirts, shoes, uniforms, jackets, coats, sweaters & more!) in sizes 0-18  \r\n\r\n<b>Gymboree -</b> bow-to-toe outfits for every special occasion in sizes 12m-12  \r\n\r\n<b>Sugar & Jade \u2013</b> trending fashion for teens sizes 8-22 \r\n\r\n<b>PJ Place \u2013</b> pajamas for every girl & boy, infant to adult sizes \r\n\r\n\u2022\tBe the first to know about the latest promotions & special discounts via push notifications \r\n\u2022\tJoin our FREE My Place Rewards program to manage your account: access your member number, earn & track your points, redeem your rewards & coupons \r\n\u2022\tStay logged in at all times to quickly place orders on the go and easily track your order status \r\n\u2022\tCheck out even faster with payment methods saved directly to your wallet \r\n\u2022\tFind locations near you and check store hours \r\n\u2022\tSave time and check if the styles, colors, and sizes you need are available in your nearest location before you go \r\n\u2022\tShop smart with in-store mode \u2013 a convenient barcode scanner to view product descriptions, ratings & reviews",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Children\u2019s Place app is here with a NEW look and even more features that make shopping our retail family of brands better than ever! <br><br>\u2022\tShop 4 brands in 1 place: <br><br><b>The Children\u2019s Place \u2013</b> all the toddler-to-big kid clothing (dresses, shirts, shoes, uniforms, jackets, coats, sweaters &amp; more!) in sizes 0-18  <br><br><b>Gymboree -</b> bow-to-toe outfits for every special occasion in sizes 12m-12  <br><br><b>Sugar &amp; Jade \u2013</b> trending fashion for teens sizes 8-22 <br><br><b>PJ Place \u2013</b> pajamas for every girl &amp; boy, infant to adult sizes <br><br>\u2022\tBe the first to know about the latest promotions &amp; special discounts via push notifications <br>\u2022\tJoin our FREE My Place Rewards program to manage your account: access your member number, earn &amp; track your points, redeem your rewards &amp; coupons <br>\u2022\tStay logged in at all times to quickly place orders on the go and easily track your order status <br>\u2022\tCheck out even faster with payment methods saved directly to your wallet <br>\u2022\tFind locations near you and check store hours <br>\u2022\tSave time and check if the styles, colors, and sizes you need are available in your nearest location before you go <br>\u2022\tShop smart with in-store mode \u2013 a convenient barcode scanner to view product descriptions, ratings &amp; reviews",
